You don't always succeed (at least I don't know a 100% sure way) on the
monster's home level because the home levels of all the baddies (ones that
have a home level) are no-teleport.
When the bad guy gets to the stairs, you may try being for example a chess
knight's move away and wait there until the bad guy moves and then try to
beat him going there. Or you may let him go up to a level where you CAN
teleport. Sometimes one of these tricks eventually work.

